  "description": "Golden Gate Feudal Aggression: This strategy focuses on early pressure in Feudal Age, using the Golden Gate to generate gold by selling tickets. It leverages the extra wood income from Wooden Fortresses, which are later sold for gold through the Golden Gate. Ideal for triple-unit compositions, all-ins, or a strong castle timing around the 12-minute mark.",
